{
  "schema_version": "prompt-runtime.program-scenario.v1",
  "story_path": "user_stories/metrics-store-ports.md",
  "criteria": [
    {
      "id": "AC1",
      "text": "`readEvents` reads retained events, sources, and snapshots from `ledger.read`, and raises `invalid-ledger` when the root path is blank."
    },
    {
      "id": "AC2",
      "text": "`appendEvents` deduplicates identical events by `source` and `id`, retains conflicting payloads with the same `source` and `id`, persists the updated ledger via `ledger.write`, and raises `invalid-metrics-event` without writing when an event contains a query-string or localhost URL."
    },
    {
      "id": "AC3",
      "text": "`exportMetrics` builds a `pdd.metrics.export.v1` bundle with `scope: \"all-retained-repo-events\"` and installation metadata from `installation.read`, and raises `invalid-export-metadata` without reading the ledger when `repo` or `timezone` is invalid."
    },
    {
      "id": "AC4",
      "text": "`importMetrics` unions compatible bundle events, sources, and snapshots into the ledger and raises `invalid-metrics-bundle` before any write when a bundle has an unsupported scope."
    },
    {
      "id": "AC5",
      "text": "`validateSnapshot` returns `{valid: true}` for a canonical selector snapshot and raises `invalid-selector-snapshot` when the snapshot repository does not match or issue numbers repeat."
    }
  ],
